[external-link-cases
  [doc [#
scripts/gen_site/check_external_links_cases.cxd — the external-link check's
case table (#1778, RULED: FIX-1, CXF-8).

`check_external_links.cx --self-test` grades each case offline: the fetch is
planted — `[a …]` children are the answers to the first, second, third try,
in order (the last one repeats) — and the verdict, the tries spent and the
line's word are compared with the row. An answer is an HTTP status, or
`error <code>` when the request itself failed (no route, a refused or timed-out
connection: a TRANSPORT error, not a status).

  want=ok           the URL answered (below 400), or answered the status an
                    allowlist row expects
  want=DEAD         it answered a status that is no answer (404, 410, 503 …)
                    and no row expects it — a status is never retried
  want=UNREACHABLE  every try failed in transport; the line says how many

expect= is the status an allowlist row accepts for the URL ('' for none).
Measured 2026-10-04 on Site run 37172899968: two binding-repository URLs
answered CXER4534 (the 20 s whole-request deadline) and CXER4506 (connect
failed) on the macOS runner and were called DEAD after one try; fetched
again anonymously the same hour both answered 404 — private repositories,
which the cx-home/cx- prefix row expects.
#]]

  [case id=status-200 expect='' want=ok tries=1 [a '200']]
  [case id=status-404-unexpected expect='' want=DEAD tries=1 [a '404']]
  [case id=status-410-unexpected expect='' want=DEAD tries=1 [a '410']]
  [case id=status-503-not-retried expect='' want=DEAD tries=1 [a '503'] [a '200']]
  [case id=status-404-expected expect='404' want=ok tries=1 [a '404']]
  [case id=connect-then-404-expected expect='404' want=ok tries=2
        [a 'error cx-err:CXER4506'] [a '404']]
  [case id=timeout-then-404-unexpected expect='' want=DEAD tries=2
        [a 'error cx-err:CXER4534'] [a '404']]
  [case id=timeout-timeout-200 expect='' want=ok tries=3
        [a 'error cx-err:CXER4534'] [a 'error cx-err:CXER4534'] [a '200']]
  [case id=connect-every-try expect='' want=UNREACHABLE tries=3
        [a 'error cx-err:CXER4506']]
  [case id=connect-every-try-expected-404 expect='404' want=UNREACHABLE tries=3
        [a 'error cx-err:CXER4506']]
]
